WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.879
Another thing that Dr. Bright is not allowed
to do at the SCP Foundation: Produce, create

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.799
or remind staff of "SCP Robot Wars".

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:11.940
Granted, getting robots to duke it out is
undeniably less destructive than organized

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.150
battles between flesh-and-blood SCPs, but
considering the collateral damage of the time

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:21.590
you had the Pesterbot fight SCP-5514, the
Dragonslayer, we think it’s best that we

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.460
just stick to the bi-annual company volleyball
session.

